00:11.025" end="00:11.025"><span begin="00:11.025" end="00:11.025">Lana Del Rey：</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:11.025" end="00:12.733"><span begin="00:11.025" end="00:11.424">I </span><span begin="00:11.424" end="00:11.646">had </span><span begin="00:11.646" end="00:11.950">a </span><span begin="00:11.950" end="00:12.733">vision</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:14.544" end="00:18.313"><span begin="00:14.544" end="00:14.816">A </span><span begin="00:14.816" end="00:15.503">vision </span><span begin="00:15.503" end="00:15.782">of </span><span begin="00:15.782" end="00:16.077">my </span><span begin="00:16.077" end="00:17.132">nails </span><span begin="00:17.132" end="00:17.370">in </span><span begin="00:17.370" end="00:17.570">the </span><span begin="00:17.570" end="00:18.313">kitchen</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:20.089" end="00:23.371"><span begin="00:20.089" end="00:20.912">Scratching </span><span begin="00:20.912" end="00:21.415">counter </span><span begin="00:21.415" end="00:22.310">tops </span><span begin="00:22.310" end="00:22.549">I </span><span begin="00:22.549" end="00:22.803">was </span><span begin="00:22.803" end="00:23.371">screaming</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:25.201" end="00:31.804"><span begin="00:25.201" end="00:25.396">My </span><span begin="00:25.396" end="00:25.699">back </span><span begin="00:25.699" end="00:26.194">arched </span><span begin="00:26.194" end="00:26.401">like </span><span begin="00:26.401" end="00:26.648">a </span><span begin="00:26.648" end="00:27.655">cat </span><span begin="00:27.655" end="00:27.902">my </span><span begin="00:27.902" end="00:28.893">position </span><span begin="00:28.893" end="00:29.316">couldn't </span><span begin="00:29.316" end="00:30.240">stop </span><span begin="00:30.240" end="00:30.567">you </span><span begin="00:30.567" end="00:30.814">were </span><span begin="00:30.814" end="00:31.437">hitting </span><span begin="00:31.437" end="00:31.804">it</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.090" end="00:39.244"><span begin="00:32.090" end="00:32.294">And </span><span begin="00:32.294" end="00:34.564">I </span><span begin="00:34.564" end="00:34.787">shouldn't </span><span begin="00:34.787" end="00:35.664">cry </span><span begin="00:35.664" end="00:35.839">but </span><span begin="00:35.839" end="00:35.974">I </span><span begin="00:35.974" end="00:36.101">love </span><span begin="00:36.101" end="00:37.141">it </span><span begin="00:37.141" end="00:39.244">Starboy</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.389" end="00:48.951"><span begin="00:42.389" end="00:42.652">And </span><span begin="00:42.652" end="00:45.171">I </span><span begin="00:45.171" end="00:45.394">shouldn't </span><span begin="00:45.394" end="00:46.355">cry </span><span begin="00:46.355" end="00:46.538">but </span><span begin="00:46.538" end="00:46.689">I </span><span begin="00:46.689" end="00:46.800">love </span><span begin="00:46.800" end="00:46.991">it </span><span begin="00:46.991" end="00:47.174">I </span><span begin="00:47.174" end="00:47.325">love </span><span begin="00:47.325" end="00:47.908">it </span><span begin="00:47.908" end="00:48.951">Starboy</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.451" end="01:00.626"><span begin="00:53.451" end="00:53.666">And </span><span begin="00:53.666" end="00:55.849">I </span><span begin="00:55.849" end="00:56.088">shouldn't </span><span begin="00:56.088" end="00:57.015">cry </span><span begin="00:57.015" end="00:57.222">but </span><span begin="00:57.222" end="00:57.445">I </span><span begin="00:57.445" end="00:57.660">love </span><span begin="00:57.660" end="00:58.611">it </span><span begin="00:58.611" end="01:00.626">Starboy</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:03.899" end="01:11.568"><span begin="01:03.899" end="01:04.058">And </span><span begin="01:04.058" end="01:06.527">I </span><span begin="01:06.527" end="01:06.782">shouldn't </span><span begin="01:06.782" end="01:07.893">cry </span><span begin="01:07.893" end="01:08.100">but </span>